{
  "description": "The inline approval prompt the MCP proxy raises on an elicitation-capable client (_inline_approval_request), the reply kinds it classifies (_approval_payload then _inline_approval_kind) and the blocks a denied or invalid reply produces (_inline_approval_deny_result). The relay raises the same prompt and classifies the same replies, and its resident routes the result.",
